 const message=`Hello Ceylon Wellness ðŸ‘‹\nIâ€™ve submitted my wellness journey request.\n\nRef: ${journeyRef}\nName: ${contactName||'Traveller'}\nPreferred currency: ${quoteCurrency}\nDestinations: ${destinations.join(', ')||'To be discussed'}\n\nIâ€™d like the Ceylon Wellness Team to review my preferences and prepare my personalised journey plan and quotation. ðŸŒ¿`;
